        "new_units": [
          {
            "key": "806cd6de6cae2a85f27bbd98cd5cff4496a8bf5005276f544cbf89d838a2f3cf",
            "voice": "en-US-AndrewMultilingualNeural",
            "language": "en",
            "text": "Teoria da Gravitação Luminodinâmica. The starting postulate assigns the identity operator value 1 in the state. We follow that preserved identity.",
            "text_sha256": "2f81ad29d67b7feaeb36e8bdb667441a9812b768a94cdac1ed296d83ade10835"
          },
          {
            "key": "6bcd9a6e2c57b0e200afe6d78a7afeee86dd6cf0b446a5154aabf4f008f0c9bd",
            "voice": "pt-BR-AntonioNeural",
            "language": "pt-BR",
            "text": "Teoria da Gravitação Luminodinâmica. O postulado inicial atribui valor 1 ao operador identidade no estado. Seguimos essa identidade preservada.",
            "text_sha256": "e2d227729d463ead7fb1a627cc77e50e088a842e567b51266c2bb6e310229db0"
          },
          {
            "key": "b53ddb715961179afb40c97cf34a67ec215e3f1dac3ea1a7c3d1ab50149cbe12",
            "voice": "en-US-AndrewMultilingualNeural",
            "language": "en",
            "text": "This geometry illustrates an ontological reading; the cosmic setting serves the presentation. Now the boundary takes shape.",
            "text_sha256": "1ef60d7f4f1c80f366484c500bb5e42ebe78a6391aa53a063914b016faf63898"
          },
          {
            "key": "5b06abafd30385f86f7657a36884fd4bf1d43bf46fffa5cef22dbb6c8f8ad9be",
            "voice": "pt-BR-AntonioNeural",
            "language": "pt-BR",
            "text": "Esta geometria ilustra uma leitura ontológica; o cenário cósmico serve à apresentação. Agora a fronteira toma forma.",
            "text_sha256": "e5a0a1b556fcdae2c5b621c21caf3ed03dd88ef3305aa824f98b9f68ab06b9a6"
          },
          {
            "key": "3cfd4a4808a3b5d2e9fd710ca42ea5495ed86f722b077f6a6541af346c273975",
            "voice": "en-US-AndrewMultilingualNeural",
            "language": "en",
            "text": "Here, boundary entropy is 0.5 nat. Exponentiating it gives the minimum volume: the square root of Euler’s number.",
            "text_sha256": "1e7caae3803761a9e875e9057a7f9b2db6be04859948ff74c88b9be618a49e34"
          },
          {
            "key": "7443ad42bef2e783bf9e5222d11b0e075bb209f74e80c4b1992164e219cae042",
            "voice": "pt-BR-AntonioNeural",
            "language": "pt-BR",
            "text": "Aqui, a entropia da fronteira é 0,5 nat. A exponencial desse valor dá o volume mínimo: a raiz quadrada do número de Euler.",
            "text_sha256": "1285d1119f01d3c38833ab81e79a955bfea8f47bdef213e0a2c3a3c5fa71a644"
          },
          {
            "key": "791232c21db2e7ec990c42c5d88bd4400cb6da44ac8234ce0f2a4fbf57e30e8d",
            "voice": "en-US-AndrewMultilingualNeural",
            "language": "en",
            "text": "The fine-structure constant, supplied externally, multiplies the entropic factor—the square root of Euler’s number—giving the TGL coupling rate, beta TGL.",
            "text_sha256": "d567b0576cbf93efcf715f202a1715b2215fef3cb04dbd32d421cef45befd868"
          },
          {
            "key": "a29a3b4c3b4430c8f954b811e7f68349058030610c083be1c9c6705bdea39942",
            "voice": "pt-BR-AntonioNeural",
            "language": "pt-BR",
            "text": "A constante da estrutura fina, fornecida externamente, multiplica o radical entrópico — a raiz quadrada do número de Euler —, dando a taxa de acoplamento beta TGL.",
            "text_sha256": "bb8c487f19f9a4a9e90c2bfae5f4780117d84ee17912b6be182c31832b45d376"
          },
          {
            "key": "ac7705c2b49ab59f23f24e7957c7401a2429edb659139ec05b29955488c3b9bd",
            "voice": "en-US-AndrewMultilingualNeural",
            "language": "en",
            "text": "It sets the reflected share; transmission carries the rest. The projection angle is 6.3 degrees.",
            "text_sha256": "e96a201b21de1ae491e99397c80c5837569aa81808aa63a5fbc22fa4adfe751b"
          },
          {
            "key": "3977d8f226475134ceddf380d358c6b775b8350b2b684c7cbdfdf494823ec9e5",
            "voice": "pt-BR-AntonioNeural",
            "language": "pt-BR",
            "text": "Ela fixa a parcela refletida; a transmissão leva o restante. O ângulo de projeção é 6,3 graus.",
            "text_sha256": "acd5be25ec208ae8470d9458e6bfcac784f245cdebfa96d14bd662c399afd115"
          },
          {
            "key": "609175efed668c1ec4ce91cf5da24c94709f4a482c57856dd2293ea3dafae4d2",
            "voice": "en-US-AndrewMultilingualNeural",
            "language": "en",
            "text": "Powers links the scales. The density distributes the zero mode’s weight, separated from the other modes by Breuer’s local gap.",
            "text_sha256": "869d1f9a4749fca81805c8ca16b50dcc9697875ef6fbb39714232b532dd680a6"
          },
          {
            "key": "db666352a4d640f69c069c5346c2cf5d03b788b27365d8d0ce7141e81b8b7942",
            "voice": "pt-BR-AntonioNeural",
            "language": "pt-BR",
            "text": "Powers liga as escalas. A densidade distribui o peso do modo zero, separado dos demais pelo gap local de Breuer.",
            "text_sha256": "d5b15d3763d80a61f18986ba0f969672e6c42c70d27728de518e6f8c0a974809"
          },
          {
            "key": "9ddb75cb1f95850da04d0f4a1b5bc22877d9afe26fefb67457cea255652f7436",
            "voice": "en-US-AndrewMultilingualNeural",
            "language": "en",
            "text": "Applying the reflection operation twice restores identity. Conjugation reverses the generator, so the displayed gradient reverses direction.",
            "text_sha256": "3549aee8177848ecc610c36cfa3522a0b58660ef23e13469376b3aecf66818c8"
          },
          {
            "key": "bb83912f41dd8c07ff2d566529e6ee3e4361430f7327741a4a89f64d3b92a8dc",
            "voice": "pt-BR-AntonioNeural",
            "language": "pt-BR",
            "text": "Aplicar a operação de reflexão duas vezes restaura a identidade. A conjugação inverte o gerador; assim, o gradiente exibido muda de sentido.",
            "text_sha256": "3839c1650b476717ba168b57d766bea91a528d69801b40af0447b520ed837686"
          },
          {
            "key": "0428bcb6176bfdbba4cc3bfcf433d3ab1db25c1e1b9d518f7232440bd48874ef",
            "voice": "en-US-AndrewMultilingualNeural",
            "language": "en",
            "text": "Soldering connects the local frame to transport. Changing the order leaves a rotation; a small loop reveals curvature.",
            "text_sha256": "6c6605eac4f953f7ba0f0dc44dfd79f960660bdb492b0ab8a1abbbc6462f67b3"
          },
          {
            "key": "25a216c66c179566172becda908c1c87ec26940eafb0e7901f505567e186cad1",
            "voice": "pt-BR-AntonioNeural",
            "language": "pt-BR",
            "text": "A solda liga o referencial local ao transporte. Mudar a ordem deixa uma rotação; um pequeno circuito revela a curvatura.",
            "text_sha256": "6bc78642dfffae5a06412290b537132a6e2b22b61e52e9aae66193fffb424732"
          },
          {
            "key": "4356f4f43a6df8f7f82679dc1e10c945f43bb3b8daeaa3f96367ae51ba3a9fec",
            "voice": "en-US-AndrewMultilingualNeural",
            "language": "en",
            "text": "In the Pentad, assume finite trace of the kernel projection and a local spectral gap; the coframe organizes Lorentz directions; Clausius links heat and horizon area.",
            "text_sha256": "892e554a85e5d84569ba2ef8a92f66e16477c075842c6642d1687f8eccedba90"
          },
          {
            "key": "7399bc85637676ae19d3328c0f27408c7615f1df697e9e2891bddae964111936",
            "voice": "pt-BR-AntonioNeural",
            "language": "pt-BR",
            "text": "Na Pêntada, supomos traço finito da projeção sobre o núcleo e gap espectral local; o coframe organiza direções de Lorentz; Clausius liga calor e área no horizonte.",
            "text_sha256": "e21e628050cae8c59bece37b6f9f9ddb4dfc622351f601d1f53ec0c2f40fd384"
          },
          {
            "key": "96f4502fa5ad8d1ab33cd1aaa528f2854ed5855027f48402d7488d524f7ffb85",
            "voice": "en-US-AndrewMultilingualNeural",
            "language": "en",
            "text": "Identity returns with residual 0. The proof ladder now displays 9679 ladder flags (named declarations), all clean.",
            "text_sha256": "05c2c89a27a8d18394040063d8cde9b0002dee1aecbf711880da180a47ce8502"
          },
          {
            "key": "c4557d106dc80616c311623a6928e397a4c4a9357bcfb11e92bba59088c0b173",
            "voice": "pt-BR-AntonioNeural",
            "language": "pt-BR",
            "text": "A identidade retorna com resíduo 0. A escada de prova exibe 9679 bandeiras da escada (declarações nomeadas), todas limpas.",
            "text_sha256": "816380f95ad2126bae4fbcd4c5b25107aaff427d647a7bb8c511f518151f4b44"
          },
          {
            "key": "7a55336345b793e0b62f1c2ff968f8fad4593f9f8c73985af2c4d0e6b3a5ec18",
            "voice": "en-US-AndrewMultilingualNeural",
            "language": "en",
            "text": "The three supports count together, each with its own status: calibrated separation 4.44, one-sided probability 0.00000443, threshold 5 sigma. The result remains below it.",
            "text_sha256": "28b4a74667237342ccc745b2172c5ff511f2191946a4c04081d39e30310493c0"
          },
          {
            "key": "aa0bbfbbb9f46c435058d1883179d2e85df4447eef978fc2a9a68ed91f3d9c5f",
            "voice": "pt-BR-AntonioNeural",
            "language": "pt-BR",
            "text": "Os três apoios contam juntos, cada um com o seu estatuto: separação calibrada 4,44, probabilidade unilateral 0,00000443, limiar 5 sigma. O resultado permanece abaixo dele.",
            "text_sha256": "69b80e6167fe037d194b24171295fa63e60086a1c285d0b780b15aa10dee3ccc"
          },
          {
            "key": "b5929c0b652a5d056d8625c268110223caeedeffe19922001cf69d5ef45d49b3",
            "voice": "en-US-AndrewMultilingualNeural",
            "language": "en",
            "text": "The model’s offset is -1.48: not falsified with power. Bayesian evidence uses another scale. Kernel validity holds under hypotheses; nature decides.",
            "text_sha256": "398ba174fda2ab3aa30a3ee218743f3dc3bed461ae3d7ec4e0f0e543451d411b"
          },
          {
            "key": "b7568e1cce5dba8b2f56ec8524bcd9d99db2757f922c3c2bdd87adaa3f068eaa",
            "voice": "pt-BR-AntonioNeural",
            "language": "pt-BR",
            "text": "O desvio do modelo é -1,48: não falsificada com poder. Evidência bayesiana usa outra escala. Validade no kernel sob hipóteses; a natureza decide.",
            "text_sha256": "826c1b8c1bad87753b35468f0843a6e2ecf7b7804f494aa630c0d2bdfb4dbdba"
          },
          {
            "key": "fc1971d797bb342544208e6b9c108349f2ee410a107b625b03ae2fa2e4577da4",
            "voice": "en-US-AndrewMultilingualNeural",
            "language": "en",
            "text": "The density curve shows how the zero mode’s weight is distributed along the modular coordinate. Breuer’s local gap separates it from the other modes.",
            "text_sha256": "b65d2af4b96f1aee2e60e00ce158b2031fd47328453a7cb8d6a8a22904fc841a"
          },
          {
            "key": "f9c6891ca41356b271713e2371b25b1ca3f708f9605fb008f176151cb8a686d5",
            "voice": "pt-BR-AntonioNeural",
            "language": "pt-BR",
            "text": "A curva de densidade mostra como o peso do modo zero se distribui na coordenada modular. O gap local de Breuer o separa dos demais modos.",
            "text_sha256": "e8e36b9eb956446e9919e3539460aa47df85b8dc82636734720a151c450498dc"
          },
          {
            "key": "99037af49dadf7485d0eaec411b2afa445aee601d9afc072f023095d460f5d42",
            "voice": "en-US-AndrewMultilingualNeural",
            "language": "en",
            "text": "The Powers ladder links scales; the coframe supplies local directions. Changes of frame in different directions depend on their order, leaving the rotation shown in the Lorentz relation.",
            "text_sha256": "32a68d0d57b2d1d92655687f70c2ea8cbb3794021a8d429482378f3111c706bf"
          },
          {
            "key": "1163331e39c97334a4673aaa1e70ef6120dd0f445b98632f4cf6a63fffd84dd4",
            "voice": "pt-BR-AntonioNeural",
            "language": "pt-BR",
            "text": "A cadeia de Powers liga escalas; o coframe fornece direções locais. Mudanças de referencial em direções diferentes dependem da ordem, deixando a rotação mostrada na relação de Lorentz.",
            "text_sha256": "9cdaeebadb232f057b0acec49859bc839f26ea3cf6e7ad7a89c1208e4160d34b"
          },
          {
            "key": "fc52a19f2184d0a196660325b943bdd403f702349e5180508ff86b2b778c8ab6",
            "voice": "en-US-AndrewMultilingualNeural",
            "language": "en",
            "text": "Soldering links the frame to geometry. The generators describe infinitesimal changes of frame; their order leaves the rotation measured by the commutator.",
            "text_sha256": "8121c9db174b5cb875e7e8748ad9966b89ac237ca33b86265389f6c72717d055"
          },
          {
            "key": "41f17dd49fadc32eb3cb0c2388f6f19fd44bcb24aef90d72581a14309055fbd2",
            "voice": "pt-BR-AntonioNeural",
            "language": "pt-BR",
            "text": "A solda liga o referencial à geometria. Os geradores descrevem mudanças infinitesimais de referencial; a ordem dessas operações deixa a rotação medida pelo comutador.",
            "text_sha256": "8916fb9c80b08f8e4fb6746a19a810e99e1e7698dfe71492e9d800d460a977b6"
          },
          {
            "key": "7f02ec95e445588f7199befa9b8fee14f622ebf7546eccd40ea6356e8b2998e6",
            "voice": "en-US-AndrewMultilingualNeural",
            "language": "en",
            "text": "The loop’s mismatch measures holonomy. The curvature formula relates it to the product of the generator coefficients.",
            "text_sha256": "22c8ba456a01453870598a6a51a685579027a3ffa6577e75c8488251f46f1294"
          },
          {
            "key": "0c0597cef8b4fc4ff1bcca1d78c2df6805f2cb0b0d835a58b274828904082224",
            "voice": "pt-BR-AntonioNeural",
            "language": "pt-BR",
            "text": "O desajuste ao fechar o circuito mede a holonomia. A fórmula da curvatura o relaciona ao produto dos coeficientes dos geradores.",
            "text_sha256": "aa124f75168a8102262317a81548cdae23abeb5062458149a4db9f233f2b5095"
          },
          {
            "key": "1ca4230748ebbe66b5f470e721a4058bed7fa23e251c49749409045f9f8c4d2b",
            "voice": "en-US-AndrewMultilingualNeural",
            "language": "en",
            "text": "Spin describes how the tensor responds when the frame rotates. Opposite helicities give 2 transverse polarizations.",
            "text_sha256": "a36a783d9c933cea533bac320850506c1878d455db3865df2aaf0c801bc55bb5"
          },
          {
            "key": "238cb0c4e7a07403d9e621e5265890fbcb09c38327fcd3bf49a8475f9528e22d",
            "voice": "pt-BR-AntonioNeural",
            "language": "pt-BR",
            "text": "O spin descreve como o tensor responde à rotação do referencial. Helicidades opostas dão 2 polarizações transversais.",
            "text_sha256": "b577024d3ef0ca29dfb7a14f8fca7ddef8136212406f22d65c2dfa5217b1320f"
          },
          {
            "key": "db0a64da3c005dee73b39420ec6d78a7bed29dec9c55b44c511f353ae892fd0d",
            "voice": "en-US-AndrewMultilingualNeural",
            "language": "en",
            "text": "The first hypothesis requires finite trace of the kernel projection and a local spectral gap; the second, coframe and Lorentz geometry; the third links horizon heat and area through Clausius. Together they form the Pentad.",
            "text_sha256": "fb15132c92710e781b801a7a54a7a345fe5f09b0b981cf42344f1153fc1661a1"
          },
          {
            "key": "cb99546bd970b7d42717caeb6ad1dfeadb3811394d0e7821178ca3631cfe188f",
            "voice": "pt-BR-AntonioNeural",
            "language": "pt-BR",
            "text": "A primeira hipótese exige traço finito da projeção sobre o núcleo e gap espectral local; a segunda, coframe e geometria de Lorentz; a terceira liga calor e área no horizonte por Clausius. Juntas, compõem a Pêntada.",
            "text_sha256": "e6a5b03d7cdabdf157e13539dbb4cebf8364b2a2d6e18bcb6ceaf48fe4f6e7ab"
          },
          {
            "key": "ab0bd0dbb51f8ca20fb6444ad3e4f2776b20c3962664189bf7b079b16d376a93",
            "voice": "en-US-AndrewMultilingualNeural",
            "language": "en",
            "text": "Clausius links heat, surface gravity and area, yielding Einstein’s coefficient. The kernel ladder has 9679 ladder flags (named declarations), all clean; the gate has 15 calculated and 3 literal flags.",
            "text_sha256": "74e82860a0d74caa3b3edb87233ae1972b95937b2d68835427aa0431e0388459"
          },
          {
            "key": "6779ef2d876c6fadc0be13ed6564e72b6face89d562ac67a735ad05138f58517",
            "voice": "pt-BR-AntonioNeural",
            "language": "pt-BR",
